{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_astesi_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_astesi_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"復耀","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_astesi_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"7ddaa3f8227ac2b9bd98d91f3547c6f75c106b1fe49e5b37a7b212387e861efc","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"哥倫比亞，特里蒙"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想應該沒有需要繼續修改的地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，吉妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，應該的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說我也沒做什麼，只是幫你提供基礎資料架構，順便調整一下而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"內容和整體框架布局，不還是姐姐你做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再過一周，占星研究協會的會堂討論就要開始了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特里蒙天上的空洞一定給你帶來了很多麻煩吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我們家應該沒什麼影響，畢竟父親母親不是喜歡搭空中樓閣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……父親母親已經到特里蒙有一段時間了，我忙著寫東西，還沒時間去見他們兩位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想見見他們嗎，吉妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別，除了姐姐你，我見到姓烏比卡的就頭痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，姐姐，你的這篇……就當是研究內容吧，準備怎麼用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在宣講以後無償提供給學界吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特里蒙空洞外的星空似乎有著完全不同的運行規律，可空洞只有這麼一點，沒法囊括所有星星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但只要有了我們研究的換算模型，所有研究者都可以初步獲得兩套系統下星座的大致座標，從而進一步推演運行規律與相對關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必這能為今後研究星空的人提供一些便利吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實像是姐姐你會做的事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你不是說，空洞後的星空帶來了新的占星可能性嗎，反正你來特里蒙的初衷已經完成了，要不——幫我看看今天的運勢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼時候又重新對這個有興趣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好玩嘛，來吧姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉思）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喃喃自語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（高舉天球儀）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像占星的結果……和以前的形式不太一樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“今日是黎博利的災難。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是星星們傳達到的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前明明可以更具體的，奇怪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來就不太吉利……唉，別在意，我也就是隨口問問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前你也給我占到過大難臨頭這個那個的，我不也一點事都沒有嗎，別太在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早餐吃完了嗎？我去拿咖啡給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝你，吉妮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快遞員","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，是阿絲忒希婭·烏比卡小姐嗎？我是來取您要快遞的文件的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快遞員","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我收到了，再和您確認一下，是送到這個地址的，佛朗索瓦·烏比卡先生手上，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，今天能送到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快遞員","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是城內快遞，而且您額外付了加急費用，沒有意外的話，今天就可以送到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快遞員","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣，很高興為您服務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快遞員","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝您生活愉快，再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有客人？是住隔壁的維多利亞老婦人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃文斯女士？不是，只是快遞員罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他來拿我給父親的文稿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是瘋了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，吉妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前是不是跟你說過很多次了，如果把文章給烏比卡先生，他就會把自己的名字添到你的名字前面？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別把父親想得那麼不堪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不堪？呵，那你告訴我，你拿得出哪怕一篇你獨自署名的文章嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我只是，我只是覺得這麼重要的內容需要他這樣的專家過目一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好啊，就算是這樣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你大可以只把問題總結出來給他，為什麼要把整個原稿影本全寄過去？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我姐姐，他一定會直接把你的內容當作在占星研究協會會堂的發言內容的，到時候這東西就和你我一點關係都沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是烏比卡家族的榮譽，由他這個一家之主來發表，我覺得沒什麼問題……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不同意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我花了那麼久從家裡逃出去是為了什麼？不就是為了能夠不用看他臉色，不用受他束縛，自由自在地生活嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在倒好了，我和你的成果，我們這幾個月辛苦鑽研的成果，就因為你一句“覺得需要他過目一下”，就這樣給他了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自私點說，那裡面也有我的研究成果，把我的成果送出去前，你是不是至少得先經過我的同意？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是沒想到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到？姐姐，你這樣做事周全的人，會不考慮這個的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，吉妮，你多慮了，這事沒有這麼嚴重。我們家是個大家族，如此重要的內容，父親只會以整個家族的名義進行署名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我曾經的稿件，父親都是多次過目提出意見甚至親自修改的，把名字加在前面他也和我陳述過利害，是我同意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我太清楚了，說一堆“為你好”之類的話，再給你許個不會實現的諾言，你就這樣簡單地相信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的言辭，埃琳娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你知道嗎，你的語調和他斥責我的時候一模一樣，阿絲忒希婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想把這件事做好，吉妮，收起你那些無端的妄想好嗎？相信我，我會處理的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從來都沒在他面前說出個不字。處理？你讓我怎麼相信你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這事到此為止，我們沒什麼好說的了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我回萊茵去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉妮……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……吉妮的通訊器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧問小姐，您怎麼了，是有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想問下萊茵生命的員工住宿區怎麼走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是要找某位職員嗎？如果是在職人員的話，我這裡可以直接打電話到宿舍裡或者工位上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就有勞您了，請幫我接能量科的埃琳娜·烏比卡研究員，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請稍候……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您確定是埃琳娜·烏比卡研究員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……烏比卡研究員申請外派的時候好像徹底從公寓裡搬出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在沒有她在萊茵住宿的記錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……她今天來過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個我可能需要先核實一下您的身分，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"派駐機構成員，文獻學顧問，阿絲忒希婭·烏比卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（遞上身分證明）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……核實無誤，請稍等，我幫您查一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，烏比卡研究員今天沒有進入過任何萊茵生命設施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒有回萊茵嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是這樣的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個不祥的念頭從她心頭湧現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（“今日是黎博利的災難。”）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵櫃檯人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼需要我幫忙的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒有了，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（別嚇唬自己了，不會有事的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她只是沒帶通訊器，暫時聯絡不上。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（說不定只是，只是在特里蒙城裡散步呢？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒記錯的話，警署是往這邊走吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（得先找到她……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警……"},{"type":"narration","text":"到了嘴邊的話語被她硬生生吞了回去。\n因為一個假設的誕生。\n現在占星學家們雲集特里蒙，她的父親又是此間翹楚。\n如果這時候，記者們發現，他的一個叛逆女兒杳無音訊。\n毫無疑問，那會是個絕佳的新聞。\n到時候，無論對家族，對父母，對自己的妹妹，都會是場無妄之災。\n於是……\n她就這樣從警局門前走過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（對不起，吉妮，我真是個沒用的姐姐……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（再想想，星極，你會有辦法的……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前面的人讓開，都讓開！車子失控了！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（現在去找誰比較好呢？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，你沒事吧，有受傷嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不好意思，我剛剛恍神了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堅雷小……姐？你怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我還在想這身影總覺得在哪裡看過，原來是你啊星極。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真是倒楣啊，大白天的被車直直撞過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那車的司機也是。大概是哪個零件壞掉車失控了，躲了半天最後還是差點撞到人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司機先生沒事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"最後好像煞車了，只是車翻了個底朝天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"人……沒事，他已經從車廂裡爬出來了，現在坐在車旁打電話呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是不幸，要是羅德島……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我還能找羅德島！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堅雷小姐，您現在方便嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……暫時沒什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想請您，請羅德島做些事，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"先回特里蒙辦事處吧，這裡不是說話的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g2_luo_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"來，喝口水吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽下來覺得，好像只是姐妹吵架後妹妹賭氣出走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不明白，今天占星結果並不理想，她，她很有可能遇上麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"遇上麻煩的不是你嗎？你剛剛還差點被車給撞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不要緊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你在某些方面還真是倔強呢……就跟我家那位一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的，姐姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我妹妹，血緣上的。這次來特里蒙也是因為她在跟那些裝神弄……咳，那些占星學家做生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"正好最近預備幹員大多放假了，閒著也是閒著，就來這裡幫忙做點事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們關係還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好是好啦，只是偶爾會覺得她管得太多了，也喜歡不徵求我意見就為我做這做那的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而她是您的……妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"血緣上的妹妹，但相處模式上，她可能算是姐姐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"家裡多虧有她這個頂樑柱，父親走了以後家裡生意反而更好了，而我這個當姐姐的呢，一事無成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢，您教給幹員們的是活下來的技巧，我們都很感謝您。當初您可是一劍就把我甩飛出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候我也沒來多久，對抗的時候只是看你在那裡耍劍花，半天沒有攻擊就……唉，不談了不談了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要特里蒙辦事處這邊幫你找星源吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"辦公室這裡應該還有幾位偵察幹員暫時沒有任務，你可以把你妹妹可能去的地方給他們，他們不會拒絕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不希望公開發布的話，我想可以私下交付任務，我和他們也都說得上話，可以幫你敲定很多事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"應該的，家家都有難念的經。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"郵件已經私傳給他們了，我們也出發吧，我和你去剩下的地方找找看，或許能找到些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，沒人會受傷的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"星源還真是能躲啊，我們明明把大部分公共區域都給搜遍了，怎麼連個人影都沒看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"天色不早了，再找下去也不是辦法，我先送你回去休息，我們明天繼續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……還想再找一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這都快凌晨了，你想啊，你的占卜裡只說過今天運氣好不了，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吃頓熱飯，好好休息一晚上，明天說不定運氣就好起來了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"先回去吧，要我送嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了……謝謝……麻煩您一天了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先走了，多保重，別做傻事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"明天我會早點來找你，晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"星極一個人走在回家的路上，星星已經從特里蒙上空的空洞中顯現。\n但她只是盯著前方的路，轉過一個又一個彎。\n當鐘錶的指針走過了十二點，她也轉過最後一個路口，來到了租借的公寓前。\n在那裡，她看到了一團蜷縮的羽球。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你回來啦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忘帶鑰匙了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，姐姐？"},{"type":"narration","text":"星極沒有說話，她只是撲在妹妹懷裡，不停地哭。\n她控制不住自己，也就不想讓妹妹看到自己的臉。\n星源也很明白這一點，所以她只是抱著姐姐，任由她的淚水染濕自己的衣服。\n她們就這樣默默在門口待了許久，等到兩個人情緒都穩定下來，星極才拿出鑰匙，打開了家門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"回到家裡，兩個人坐在沙發上相對無言。\n最終，還是當姐姐的先開了口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起……吉妮，是我錯了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要說錯的話，我也有錯吧……你說文件送去給父親以後，我腦袋一下就爆炸了，一點話都聽不進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為了從家裡出去犧牲了很多，我都明白的，你不希望和父親再有半點關聯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這樣做，無疑是從背後捅了你一刀，我真的，沒有想過會這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"論文報告寫完給權威導師看很正常啦，以前讀碩博的時候，導師們也沒少看少批的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，都怪我，還博士呢，連最基本的情緒管理都做不好。我還總是說你是個石頭腦，其實我才是最不聽勸的那個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我想好了，明天，我明天就去見父親，他看稿件會花一些時間，明天一早他一定沒看完，我會說服他還回來的，我們還有機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……關於這個……姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實——文稿沒能送到烏比卡先生手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快遞的小哥是位黎博利吧，天剛暗的時候他就來了，和我不停地道歉，還把快遞費退給了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他這一天也挺倒楣的，早上去各處取完貨以後貨車在路上失控側翻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後他想著你的急件，於是在同事們過來處理其他快遞後騎著自行車單獨幫你送文稿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在過企業區的時候，那裡下了會小雨，他輪胎一打滑，連人帶車摔進了景觀湖裡。文稿濕透了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他也沒辦法，只好一把鼻涕一把淚地來這裡道歉，我安慰安慰他，就把他送走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的一點沒錯，姐姐，今天對於黎博利來說確實是個災難……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都過去了，別再想它了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給，這是你的終端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，都怪這在特里蒙攻讀學位的時候養成的壞毛病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時候腦袋卡住了或是跟別人有衝突了，心裡就會有種什麼都不去管的衝動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，我就會通訊器一丟，遠離電話和郵件，放空自己，在特里蒙到處逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有解決不了的情緒，都交給時間去處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，偶爾也會像今天這樣，忘了鑰匙，只能在宿舍門口等同學回來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一天都沒吃飯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有……出去的時候吃不下，回來了在門外面也沒的吃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那門外的盒子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個本來是用來向你賠禮道歉的雪糕，但我沒想到你為了找我現在才回來，雪糕早化了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上的錢呢，別餓著自己啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"買完禮物就沒錢啦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐，我餓了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在就幫你做，再忍耐一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉妮，我答應你，這是我們的成果，我不會拱手讓給別人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使那人是我們的父親，他也沒資格把它拿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"一週後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你的宣講稿我都看過了，沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給你的專業術語你都背下來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，這樣老學究們揪著字詞找麻煩的時候，你就可以輕鬆打敗他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你說你下午宣講，我看行程上沒有你的宣講時間啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得隔壁的埃文斯女士嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位老婦人？她有什麼手段嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是維多利亞的占星權威，今天下午原本是她的宣講時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說服她把機會讓給我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是不是意味著烏比卡先生身旁那個位置要空著了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會的，吉妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……姐姐，你看著我做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會是想要……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給父親一個驚喜？告訴他自己最貼心的女兒也跟妹妹那樣學壞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜託了，吉妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是早就想好了？怪不得和占星研究協會有關的事，一個字都不肯說，在這裡等著我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我可以不去嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃避是沒有結果的，吉妮，這樣你不就有一個堂堂正正和父親對決的機會了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來，把護目鏡和儀器拿掉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"外套和襯衫也換一件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的要這樣做嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就當是惡作劇吧，你最喜歡的惡作劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是，姐，我從來沒有喜歡過惡作劇啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把頭髮散下來，乖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，是不是有點過了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別說話，拿好劍和天球儀，我幫你化一下妝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，完美。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極？","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這方法不太好，真的，姐姐……我們還可以想其他的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉吉妮，會議馬上要開始了，已經來不及想其他辦法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"用我的語調說句話試試看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希婭，這，這是不是不太妥當……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸呸呸，不行，我不適合用這個聲線說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很恰當啊，太完美了，妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這真的能瞞過烏比卡先生嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不需要瞞過父親，你只要瞞過別人就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我穿了你的衣服，你穿哪一件去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然是最正式的那件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“尋耀”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g6_mainstreet"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，還是輕便的衣服穿著舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我不太懂，但大部分時間就像是無效的論文研討環節……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有姐姐你那場演講，我早就離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那關於父親的部分呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他確實是位好學者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別人嘴裡都是傳統觀念至高無上，他倒是願意站在台前承認眼前的變化，告訴他人知識也要不斷更新。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看他駁斥那些老頑固的樣子和駁斥我們也沒什麼區別，至少，他是個表裡如一的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……雖然這並不能改變他和斐爾迪南一樣是個不可救藥的混蛋這一事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那母親呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她啊，她就和往常一樣，像個雕塑一樣帶著那冷冰冰的眼神盯著所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也沒對你的裝扮有意見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們兩位見到我挑了下眉毛就結束了，連一句“你來了，阿絲忒希婭”都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能我遇到他們那一刻就暴露了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不說這些無聊的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的演講真不錯，從頭到尾，烏比卡家的兩個老頑固都沒提出任何問題來駁斥你，其他挑刺的傢伙也被你三兩下就解決了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說已經有記者採訪過你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，問了些普通人都會問的問題。倒是有兩位從其他國家來的學者提了些問題給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們留了通訊方式，今後可以深入探討整個模型的改良方向以及在學界的推廣運用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於父親和母親……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們一定是直視前方，用著最嚴苛的語氣，向你表達了對我的不滿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們一直都這樣，十幾年了，從來沒改變過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（陰陽怪氣）“希望阿絲忒希婭能明白她在家族中的位置。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一看就是被你給氣壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，別這樣，吉妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那接下來你準備怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們再在特里蒙住一段時間吧，忙了那麼久，也沒出去觀光購物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這棟房子的租約還有段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等這裡的事情處理完，父親氣也消得差不多了，我就回去給他個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會明確地告訴他，這是我和我妹妹共同努力的結晶，我不會接受他在上面寫下自己的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐終於開竅了，太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢，吉妮，你準備回萊茵嗎？我聽說你的導師在萊茵生命重新成了主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是算了吧，我聽同事說，他使喚人的態度比以前更惡劣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，斐爾迪南主任現在的計劃……很有吸引力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"研究將建築送入天空的能源，有誰不憧憬呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在他那樣的人手下工作，還是算了吧，沒有必要因為一個機會重新回到他的壓迫下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經決定了，我不會後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會以你為榜樣的，吉妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你已經是我的榜樣了，姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，偶爾聽聽妹妹誇獎也不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天就不煮飯了，我們去餐廳吃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要是準備回家了，和我說一聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是……不準備回去了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我得讓烏比卡先生知道，在反抗他這件事上，我們姐妹倆是一致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有那麼嚴重吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要不願意，我也可以不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不是這個意思，吉妮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_260_durnar","aliases":["堅雷"]}]}
